      "side": 1,
      "message": "The guard covers a missing entry only. With `arista: {enabled: false}` (no username) in plugins.yml, `--network-plugin arista` writes `arista: {enabled: True}` (probe). AristaSwitchPlugin.initialize() then returns True with username\u003dNone, SSHHelper falls back to the process user, and the first move fails at connect. Also require `entry.get(\u0027username\u0027)` for the selected vendor names here.",
      "revId": "ffb28c38cb50c8ca73ef812cdcfba4dea36d7fcf",
