      "side": 1,
      "message": "This still rewrites the whole file. Probe on the shipped conf/plugins.yml: 35 comment lines before, 1 after, and the switch-driver guidance added in this change is gone. os.replace also leaves the new file owned by the invoking user. README and docs recommend this command, so a targeted edit of the three enabled keys, or a warning that comments are lost, would avoid stripping the file silently.",
