      "writtenOn": "2026-11-02T21:02:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Off by default: this reads the env var with default 0, and systemd/quads-server.service is the only place that sets it to 1. A manual or non-systemd quads-server run therefore skips the startup check the commit message and docs promise. TestingConfig already overrides it to False, so ProductionConfig can default to True; otherwise document the variable. With the check off, PluginManager skips network (manager.py:36-45) and the server starts with the vendor driver after a single log warning.",
      "revId": "ffb28c38cb50c8ca73ef812cdcfba4dea36d7fcf",
